      "t": "In this scene in the kitchen, waiter Kostya rushes to Chef Viktor Barinov with terrifying news. A guest at table seven, suspected of being a secret food critic, has just sent back her salad, complaining about the sour dressing. Listen to their panicked conversation in Russian first, and then we will examine each sentence.",
